      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the deployment resource.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the deployment name.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.replicas</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the number of replicas of the deployment.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create a YAML file that defines the <code>Service</code> resource:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: <echoserver>\n  namespace: echoserver\nspec:\n  ports:\n    - port: 80\n      targetPort: 8080\n      protocol: TCP\n  type: NodePort\n  selector:\n    app: echoserver"} lang="yaml" title="Example service-albo.yaml file" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>apiVersion</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the service resource.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the service name.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>
      Create a YAML file that defines the <code>Ingress</code> resource:
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: <name>\n  namespace: echoserver\n  annotations:\n    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/scheme: internet-facing\n    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type: instance\nspec:\n  ingressClassName: alb\n  rules:\n    - http:\n        paths:\n          - path: /\n            pathType: Exact\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: <echoserver>\n                port:\n                  number: 80"} lang="yaml" title="Example ingress-albo.yaml file" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies a name for the <code>Ingress</code> resource.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>service.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the service name.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      </ol>
      <p><strong>Verification</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      Save the status of the <code>Ingress</code> resource in the <code>HOST</code> variable by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ HOST=$(oc get ingress -n echoserver echoserver --template='{{(index .status.loadBalancer.ingress 0).hostname}}')"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Verify the status of the <code>Ingress</code> resource by running the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ curl $HOST"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ul>
